37215	37405	36754	36754	he	148	“ I will tell you , Kemp , sooner or later , all the complicated processes . We need not go into that now . For the most part , saving certain gaps I chose to remember , they are written in cypher in those books that tramp has hidden . We must hunt him down . We must get those books again . But the essential phase was to place the transparent object whose refractive index was to be lowered between two radiating centres of a sort of ethereal vibration , of which I will tell you more fully later . No , not those Röntgen vibrations — I do n’t know that these others of mine have been described . Yet they are obvious enough . I needed two little dynamos , and these I worked with a cheap gas engine . My first experiment was with a bit of white wool fabric . It was the strangest thing in the world to see it in the flicker of the flashes soft and white , and then to watch it fade like a wreath of smoke and vanish .
